        "6.10. For the sake of clarity the parties specifically agree that upon termination of this Agreement by either party, In addition to the previous unsettled Commissions, the Commissions of the agent will no longer be settled.": "6.10. A\xE7\u0131kl\u0131k sa\u011Flamak amac\u0131yla taraflar, bu S\xF6zle\u015Fmenin taraflardan herhangi biri taraf\u0131ndan feshedilmesi \xFCzerine, \xF6nceki kararla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131lmam\u0131\u015F Komisyonlara ek olarak, acentenin Komisyonlar\u0131n\u0131n art\u0131k \xE7\xF6z\xFClmeyece\u011Fini \xF6zellikle kabul eder.",
