        '6.2. The commission shall be a percentage of the Game bet amount in accordance with what is set out in the commission structures for the particular product. The calculation is product specific and it is set out in every product-specific commission structure. (see "commission rules" for details)': '6.2. Komisyon, belirli bir \xFCr\xFCn i\xE7in komisyon yap\u0131lar\u0131nda belirtilenlere uygun olarak Oyun bahsi tutar\u0131n\u0131n bir y\xFCzdesi olacakt\u0131r. Hesaplama \xFCr\xFCne \xF6zeldir ve her \xFCr\xFCne \xF6zel komisyon yap\u0131s\u0131nda belirlenir. (detaylar i\xE7in "komisyon kurallar\u0131"na bak\u0131n)',
        "6.3. Users can withdraw commissions from the agent system at any time. The commissions will be withdrawn into the platform wallet. Users can also withdraw the platform wallet to any address at any time. (you can check the Commission extraction in the agent system and view transaction records in the platform wallet).": "6.3. Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar komisyonlar\u0131n\u0131 istedikleri zaman acente sisteminden \xE7ekebilirler. Komisyonlar platform c\xFCzdan\u0131na \xE7ekilecektir. Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar ayr\u0131ca platform c\xFCzdan\u0131n\u0131 istedikleri zaman istedikleri adrese \xE7ekebilirler. (Acente sisteminde Komisyon ekstraksiyonunu kontrol edebilir ve platform c\xFCzdan\u0131nda i\u015Flem kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCleyebilirsiniz).",
        "6.4. The commissions will be collected in digital currency and will only be received on the platform wallet.When applying for Withdraw, you must submit the correct wallet address on the \u201CWithdraw\u201D page.If there is an error in calculating the commission, the company has the right to amend the amount at any time and immediately settle the underpaid difference to the agent or recover the overpaid balance from the agent.": "6.4. Komisyonlar dijital para biriminde toplanacak ve sadece platform c\xFCzdan\u0131nda al\u0131nacakt\u0131r. Para \xC7ekme ba\u015Fvurusu yaparken \u201CPara \xC7ekme\u201D sayfas\u0131nda do\u011Fru c\xFCzdan adresini g\xF6ndermeniz gerekmektedir.Komisyon hesaplamas\u0131nda bir hata varsa, \u015Firket tutar\u0131 herhangi bir zamanda de\u011Fi\u015Ftirme ve eksik \xF6denen fark\u0131 derhal acenteye kapatma veya fazla \xF6denen bakiyeyi acenteden geri alma hakki vardir",
        "6.5. Agent Withdraw commission by the Affiliate shall be deemed to be full and the final settlement of the balance due for the period indicated.": "6.5. Affiliate taraf\u0131ndan Acente Para \xC7ekme komisyonu tam olarak kabul edilir ve belirtilen s\xFCre i\xE7in vadesi gelen bakiyenin nihai \xF6demesi yap\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "6.6. If the Affiliate disagrees with the balance due as reported, it shall within a period of seven (7) days send an email to the Company to admin@{{host}} and indicate the reasons for the dispute. Or contact customer service through Telegram .Failure to send an email Or contact customer service through Telegram within the prescribed time limit shall be deemed to be considered as an irrevocable acknowledgment of the balance due for the period indicated.": "6.6. \u0130\u015Ftirak, bildirilen \xF6denmesi gereken bakiyeyi kabul etmezse, yedi (7) g\xFCnl\xFCk bir s\xFCre i\xE7inde \u015Eirkete admin@{{host}} adresine bir e-posta g\xF6nderecek ve anla\u015Fmazl\u0131\u011F\u0131n nedenlerini belirtecektir. Belirtilen s\xFCre i\xE7inde e-posta g\xF6nderilmemesi veya Telegram arac\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131yla m\xFC\u015Fteri hizmetleriyle ileti\u015Fime ge\xE7ilmemesi, belirtilen d\xF6nem i\xE7in \xF6denmesi gereken bakiyenin geri al\u0131namaz bir kabul\xFC olarak kabul edilecektir.",
        "6.7. May delay the Withdraw request through the agent for up to sixty (60) days, while it investigates and verifies that the relevant transactions comply with the provisions of the Terms.": "6.7. \u0130lgili i\u015Flemlerin \u015Eartlar\u0131n h\xFCk\xFCmlerine uygun oldu\u011Funu ara\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131p do\u011Frularken, temsilci arac\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131yla Para \xC7ekme talebini altm\u0131\u015F (60) g\xFCne kadar geciktirebilir.",
