        "6.9. The Affiliate agrees to return all commissions received based on fraudulent or falsified transactions, plus all costs for legal causes or actions that may be brought against the Affiliate to the fullest extent of the law.": "6.9. Affiliate hileli veya tahrif edilmi\u015F i\u015Flemlere dayal\u0131 olarak al\u0131nan t\xFCm komisyonlar\u0131 ve ayr\u0131ca affiliate'e kar\u015F\u0131 a\xE7\u0131labilecek yasal nedenler veya davalar i\xE7in t\xFCm masraflar\u0131 yasan\u0131n en geni\u015F kapsam\u0131na kadar iade etmeyi kabul eder.",
